    <div class="container">
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">1. What products do you offer?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">We offer fresh poultry, organic eggs, and natural manure.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">2. Do you provide delivery services?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">Yes, we deliver poultry products directly to your location.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">3. How can I place an order?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">You can place an order through our website or contact us via phone.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">4. Do you offer farm visits?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">Yes, we allow scheduled farm visits for customers and partners.</div>
        </div>
